{"id":38,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">صٓ</span>‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانِ ذِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ذِّكْرِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"بَلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى عِزَّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ و</span>َشِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ق</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"كَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َرْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نٍ ف</span>َنَادَو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَّلَاتَ حِينَ مَن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>صٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"وَعَجِب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ج</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ِّنْهُمْ‌ۖ وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِرُونَ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا سَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>حِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٌ ك</span>َذّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"أَجَعَلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَلِهَةَ إِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">هًا و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>حِدًا‌ۖ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا لَشَىْءٌ عُج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نط</span>َلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلَأُ مِنْهُمْ أَنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>مْشُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>صْبِرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> ءَالِهَتِكُمْ‌ۖ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا لَش<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َىْءٌ ي</span>ُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"مَا سَمِعْنَا بِهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمِلَّةِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ إِنْ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَّا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>خْتِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ق</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"أَءُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِلَ عَلَيْهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ذِّكْرُ م<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>َيْنِنَا‌ۚ بَلْ هُمْ فِى شَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">كٍّ م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span>ِكْرِى‌ۖ بَل لَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا يَذُوقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨