\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦١</span>"},{"id":62,"tajweed":"وَقَالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مَا لَنَا لَا نَرَىٰ رِجَال<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">اً ك</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَعُدُّه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَشْر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٢</span>"},{"id":63,"tajweed":"أَتَّخَذْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ سِخْرِيًّا أَمْ زَاغَتْ عَنْهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>صَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٣</span>"},{"id":64,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَحَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">قٌّ ت</span>َخَاصُمُ أَهْلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٤</span>"},{"id":65,"tajweed":"قُلْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنَا۟ مُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ‌ۖ و</span>َمَا مِنْ إِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هٍ إِلَّا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>حِدُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَهّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٥</span>"},{"id":66,"tajweed":"رَبُّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَفَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٦</span>"},{"id":67,"tajweed":"قُلْ هُوَ نَبَؤٌاْ عَظ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٧</span>"},{"id":68,"tajweed":"أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ عَنْهُ مُعْرِض<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٨</span>"},{"id":69,"tajweed":"مَا كَانَ لِىَ مِنْ عِلْ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">مِۭ ب</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلَإِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَعْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِذْ يَخْتَصِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦٩</span>"},{"id":70,"tajweed":"إ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ي</span>ُوحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِلَىَّ إِلّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنَا۟ نَذِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٠</span>"},{"id":71,"tajweed":"إِذْ قَالَ رَبُّكَ لِلْمَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَةِ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى خَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">قُۢ ب</span>َشَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ط</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧١</span>"},{"id":72,"tajweed":"فَإِذَا سَوَّيْتُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَنَفَخْتُ فِيهِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>ُّوحِى فَقَعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> سَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>جِد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٢</span>"},{"id":73,"tajweed":"فَسَجَدَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَةُ كُلُّهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>مَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٣</span>"},{"id":74,"tajweed":"إِلّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِيسَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَكْبَرَ وَكَانَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٤</span>"},{"id":75,"tajweed":"قَالَ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>إِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِيسُ مَا مَنَعَكَ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َسْجُدَ لِمَا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تُ بِيَدَىَّ‌ۖ أَسْتَكْبَرْتَ أَمْ كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَال<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٥</span>"},{"id":76,"tajweed":"قَالَ أَنَا۟ خَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ِّنْهُ‌ۖ خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تَنِى م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>َّا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٍ و</span>َخَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ط</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٦</span>"},{"id":77,"tajweed":"قَالَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>خْرُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span> مِنْهَا فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ رَج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٧</span>"},{"id":78,"tajweed":"وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ عَلَيْكَ لَعْنَت<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٨</span>"},{"id":79,"tajweed":"قَالَ رَبِّ فَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نظ</span>ِرْن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>عَث<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧٩</span>"},{"id":80,"tajweed":"قَالَ فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نظ</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٠</span>"},{"id":81,"tajweed":"إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَعْل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>مِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨١</span>"},{"id":82,"tajweed":"قَالَ فَبِعِزَّتِكَ لَأُغْوِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>مَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٢</span>"},{"id":83,"tajweed":"إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنْهُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُخْلَص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٣</span>"},{"id":84,"tajweed":"قَالَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقُّ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقَّ أَق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>لُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨٤</span>"},{"id":85,"tajweed":"لَأَمْلَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>َ وَمِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َبِعَكَ مِنْهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>مَع<span class=\"t